  "post_title": "Emotiva procesión en Tales en honor a San Juan Bautista",
  "post_date": "2012-11-05 22:09:09",
  "post_name": "emotiva-procesion-en-tales-en-honor-a-san-juan-bautista",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Tales ha vivido este lunes el d&iacute;a grande de sus fiestas patronales con la celebraci&oacute;n de San Juan Bautista, fiesta local. Misa, masclet&agrave;, visita al Museo Etnol&oacute;gico, procesi&oacute;n, castillo de fuegos artificiales y teatro han compuesto la variedad de actos.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/11/IMG_6972.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px; \" /></p>\n<p>La procesi&oacute;n en honor a San Juan Bautista&nbsp;ha sido&nbsp;muy emotiva y ha recorridolas estrechas y sinuosas calles del centro hist&oacute;rico, por las que apenas pod&iacute;a pasar la imagen del santo, portada por los j&oacute;venes de la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas. M&aacute;s de 500 personas formaban la comitiva, entre ellas toda la Corporaci&oacute;n Municipal,&nbsp;la vicepresidenta de la Diputaci&oacute;n de Castell&oacute;n,&nbsp;Esther Pallard&oacute;, el diputado provinical Jos&eacute; Luis Jarque y el teniente de alcalde de Onda, Vicente Ram&oacute;n Peris. Iba precedida por la Escola de Dol&ccedil;ainers i Tabaleters de Tales y finalizaba con la Asociaci&oacute;n Musical Talense.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6898.jpg\" alt=\"img_6898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6899.jpg\" alt=\"img_6899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6900.jpg\" alt=\"img_6900\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6901.jpg\" alt=\"img_6901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6902.jpg\" alt=\"img_6902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6903.jpg\" alt=\"img_6903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6904.jpg\" alt=\"img_6904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6905.jpg\" alt=\"img_6905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6906.jpg\" alt=\"img_6906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6907.jpg\" alt=\"img_6907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6909.jpg\" alt=\"img_6909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6910.jpg\" alt=\"img_6910\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6911.jpg\" alt=\"img_6911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6912.jpg\" alt=\"img_6912\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6913.jpg\" alt=\"img_6913\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6914.jpg\" alt=\"img_6914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantjoantales/img_6915.jpg\" alt=\"img_6915\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proces